  "description": "A log cabin for the green planet (forge 360 V13): a building, not a ship, so it never moves and you cannot walk through its walls. Walls three logs high with a doorway at the front, a roof with a lamp, a bed and a field bench: sleep in the bed (F) to heal and to wake there instead of at the outpost after a blackout, and craft a hand drill at the bench (U, V14). Built only on the planet with air.",
